E51D:
  procedure options(main);
  /* [E2E-51/P1] VARIABLE dividend over a COMPOUND divisor: z = a /
     (b + c).  The dividend is already evidenced parked across a
     variable-divisor evaluation (F005); the question is whether
     the sum can be built INSIDE the parked region: H-D-inline
     predicts LHLD a / PUSH H / LHLD b / XCHG / LHLD c / DAD D /
     POP D / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD z.  H-D-temp predicts a
     materialised divisor cell; H-D-refuse a DR boundary on
     compound divisors (no binary witness exists either way today). */
  dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  z = a / (b + c);
end E51D;
